msgid ""
"[Import and manage transactions](import-bank-statements.md) - bring more "
"transactions into the ledger."
msgstr ""
"[Importa y gestiona los movimientos](import-bank-statements.md): "
"incorpora más movimientos al ledger."

#: ../../how-to/ledger-evidence.md:114
msgid ""
"[Correct mistakes in your ledger](correct-ledger-entries.md) - fix "
"mistakes in transaction rows."
msgstr ""
"[Corrige errores en tu ledger](correct-ledger-entries.md): corrige "
"errores en las filas de movimiento."

#: ../../how-to/ledger-evidence.md:115
msgid ""
"[Classify transactions](classify-transactions.md) - assign tax categories"
" to your transactions."
msgstr ""
"[Clasifica los movimientos](classify-transactions.md): asigna categorías "
"fiscales a tus movimientos."

